  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of cassava value chain in Gaza province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the poverty eradication in Gaza province by enabling the smallholder farmers (of which about 54% are women) and cassava SMEs to gainfully engage in the cassava value chain, sustainably increasing their employment opportunities and income generation.</narrative>
  </description>
